        "id": 1136059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-25T19:12:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried running \u0027apreset\u0027 while cr50 is in deep sleep and regular sleep. It looks like we can see both edges. I think we increased the apreset pulse duration on Reef and Gru to make sure it was long enough for us to resume and see both edges.",
      "revId": "35d2f10c00c2f92573ad23da62a8cde69623174a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
