      },
      "lineNbr": 557,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002124
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-25T22:56:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well my concern was that we can cause resets from the AP proper -- h1 has no control over that. And ensuring we see the edges is important w/o dropping them.",
