      "writtenOn": "2017-01-25T23:14:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How can you not? You have 2 GPIOs in gpio.inc with the handler set? PLT_RST_L_RED and PLT_RST_L_FED those are distinct GPIOs which call the same handler when their mask is set.",
      "revId": "35d2f10c00c2f92573ad23da62a8cde69623174a",
